# Docs that restate the entity list instead of pointing at its producer.
#
# Format: <repo>/<path>   # why this one is allowed
#
# This list may FALL or hold. It may never RISE without a human deciding so in
# the same PR that adds the line.
#
# It is EMPTY, and that is a measured state rather than an aspiration. Three
# copies existed on 2026-09-17 — all in orangecat's agent-read docs, all
# disagreeing with each other; one named `organization`, which has never been
# an entity type, and another omitted six that are. All three were replaced
# with pointers (bitbaum/orangecat#1071), and a sweep of every default branch
# in the org found no others.
#
# So the first line added here is a regression, not a backlog item.
